{"id":"444bd81bf84af2e5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-marczewski.md","title":"Marczewski's Theorem","display":"thm-marczewski — Marczewski's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-marczewski","aliases":["58-thm-marczewski"],"display":"thm-marczewski — Marczewski's Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-marczewski]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-marczewski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-marczewski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-marczewski — Marczewski's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2a25f6c61231243\" href=\"?note=f2a25f6c61231243\" title=\"58-df-marczewski\">58-df-marczewski</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\">\\(s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\\)</span> is the Marczewski null family from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2a25f6c61231243\" href=\"?note=f2a25f6c61231243\" title=\"58-df-marczewski\">58-df-marczewski</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> is the finite-union ideal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in V\">\\(F\\in V\\)</span> is a set-coded sequence of members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^0_0\">\\(s^0_0\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(s^0_0,\\mathcal P(2^\\omega))\n\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(F,\\omega,s^0_0)\n\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\in s^0_0\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(s^0_0,\\mathcal P(2^\\omega))\n\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(F,\\omega,s^0_0)\n\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\in s^0_0\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The σ-ideal conclusion is expanded into the existing ideal predicate plus closure under ranges of typed set-coded sequences; neither an unregistered <code>SigmaIdeal</code> nor an unregistered map class remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-marczewski","status":"resolved","id":"f2a25f6c61231243","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-marczewski]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-marczewski","status":"resolved","id":"f2a25f6c61231243","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ is the Marczewski null family from [[58-df-marczewski]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ is the finite-union ideal predicate from [[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s^0_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(s^0_0,\\mathcal P(2^\\omega))\n\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(F,\\omega,s^0_0)\n\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\in s^0_0\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1076,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-marczewski.md|58-thm-marczewski]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["f2a25f6c61231243","6e4f95381faac4f9","36d7463d215be751"]}